#
# Limited / Best-Effort:
#   • RHEL/Fedora/Rocky/CentOS family (GitLab Omnibus support exists but less tested)
#   • Alpine Linux (not recommended for GitLab Omnibus)
#
# Not Recommended / Unsupported:
#   • macOS (GitLab Omnibus not natively supported)
#   • Git Bash / MSYS2 / native Windows → Strong warning + recommendation to use WSL2 (Ubuntu)
#
# The script remains focused on Debian/Ubuntu as the primary target for GitLab CE.
# Cross-platform support for Certbot and nginx is kept for consistency.
